@startuml AdminViewsDashboard
' --- DIAGRAM METADATA ---
title "Sequence Diagram: Admin Views the Review Dashboard"

' --- PARTICIPANTS ---
actor Admin
participant "Frontend (Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "Backend (FastAPI)" as Backend

' --- INITIAL STATE ---
ref over Admin, Frontend, Backend : Admin is authenticated and has navigated to '/admin/manage'

' --- FLOW OF EVENTS ---
Admin -> Frontend: Lands on the Admin Management Page
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Backend: GET /contributions/review-queue
activate Backend

Backend -> Backend: Calls multiple crud functions: \n - get_pending_modification_requests() \n - get_unpublished_chapters() \n - get_unpublished_exams() \n - get_unpublished_resources()
note right of Backend: Backend aggregates and sorts all items into a single, unified list.

Backend --> Frontend: 200 OK [ReviewQueueResponse]
deactivate Backend

Frontend --> Admin: Renders the dashboard with all pending items, categorized and listed in tables.
deactivate Frontend

' --- LINK TO NEXT JOURNEY ---
ref over Admin, Frontend, Backend : The Admin can now select any item to begin the review process.

@enduml